-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §59 (part יב, יישוב חילוקי דעות): a parity
-- steering committee of the parties' representatives helps interpret and
-- apply the agreement, follows its carrying out and decides disputes over
-- them unanimously; it meets within 21 days of a party's request; the
-- Ministry of Education's and the Treasury's representatives take part,
-- and no decision stands without their consent; §29 of the Budget
-- Foundations Law keeps its force; and a one-time 7 million shekels is
-- allocated to carry its decisions out.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT budget_foundations_law
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `59`

DECLARE `Oz section 59 action` IS ONE OF
    `convene the Oz steering committee`

§§ `59(א)`

-- (א): for carrying out the agreement a parity steering committee is set
-- up, of representatives of the parties, which helps interpret and apply
-- the agreement, follows its carrying out, and decides unanimously the
-- disputes over its interpretation and application. It meets within 21
-- days of a party's request (counted from the request).
@ref akn:art_59__para_a
`the members of the Oz steering committee` MEANS
    LIST `the employer`, `the secondary teachers' organisation`

`the days within which the Oz steering committee meets` MEANS 21

`convening the Oz steering committee` MEANS
    PARTY `the steering committee`
    MUST  `convene the Oz steering committee`
    WITHIN `the days within which the Oz steering committee meets`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the steering committee` BECAUSE "§59(א): the steering committee meets within 21 days of a party's request"

§§ `59(ב)`

-- (ב): representatives of the Ministry of Education and of the Treasury
-- take part in its discussions, and every decision needs their consent.
-- With (א): a decision is the parties' representatives' unanimous one, to
-- which the Ministry's and the Treasury's representatives consent.
@ref akn:art_59__para_b
`those who take part in the Oz steering committee besides its members` MEANS
    LIST `the Ministry of Education`, `the Treasury`

GIVEN `the parties' representatives all agree` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Ministry's representatives consent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Treasury's representatives consent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Oz steering committee decides` `the parties' representatives all agree` `the Ministry's representatives consent` `the Treasury's representatives consent` IF
        `the parties' representatives all agree`
    AND `the Ministry's representatives consent`
    AND `the Treasury's representatives consent`

§§ `59(ג)`

-- (ג): for the avoidance of doubt, the section takes nothing from any
-- power under §29 of the Budget Foundations Law, 1985: a decision that
-- changes pay at an employer §29 binds (a local authority) stands only as
-- §29 lets it.
@ref akn:art_59__para_c
GIVEN `the committee decided it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `as agreed or practised for all state employees` IS A BOOLEAN
      `approved by the Finance Minister` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a steering committee decision on pay stands under section 59` `the committee decided it` `as agreed or practised for all state employees` `approved by the Finance Minister` IF
        `the committee decided it`
    AND `section 29 permits the change` `a local authority` `as agreed or practised for all state employees` `approved by the Finance Minister` FALSE

§§ `59(ד)`

-- (ד): to carry out the committee's decisions taken under this section,
-- where that needs a budget, a one-time sum of 7 million is allocated.
-- "יוקצה" names no one to allocate it (as §50's sum), so no duty is
-- written; the sum is a ceiling on what the decisions draw from it.
@ref akn:art_59__para_d
`the one-time sum section 59(ד) allocates` MEANS 7_000_000

GIVEN `drawn by the committee's decisions` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within section 59(ד)'s sum` `drawn by the committee's decisions` IF
    `drawn by the committee's decisions` AT MOST `the one-time sum section 59(ד) allocates`

§§ `59 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the Oz steering committee decides` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Oz steering committee decides` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a steering committee decision on pay stands under section 59` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `a steering committee decision on pay stands under section 59` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `within section 59(ד)'s sum` 7_000_000 AND NOT `within section 59(ד)'s sum` 7_000_001

#TRACE `convening the Oz steering committee` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the steering committee` DOES `convene the Oz steering committee` AT 21
